span></span></p></td><td><span><span>849ce59ffb2ae55e4131111acd8a511444475639ba18515509310414b1661964</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span>第二波矿机解包后的 ELF Build ID：</span></p><p><span>c492732de98117b7b28ce0e410f5966e1232e9dc</span></p><p><span>B.6 SolanaCry 指标</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span>类型</span></p></td><td><p><span>指标</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>恶意仓库</span></p></td><td><span><span>SolanaUpdateTools/solana-starter-kit</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>下载地址</span></p></td><td><span><span>developer-update[.]app/update/indicator</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>恢复载荷</span></p></td><td><span><span>indicator.ps1，</span></span><p><span>21,123,011 字节</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>载荷 SHA-256</span></p></td><td><span><span>41902d18fa2c285c0f4a6b39cf0f2eefbc7acbff33b6eb6fc88ba680a201d17d</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>隐藏目录</span></p></td><td><span><span>%LOCALAPPDATA%\\y2inwRnI6G</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>主要文件</span></p></td><td><span><span>client32.exe、</span></span><span><span>client32.ini、</span></span><span><span>PCICL32.DLL、</span></span><span><span>remcmdstub.exe</span></span><p><span>&nbsp;等</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>控制端</span></p></td><td><span><span>maxwintodaybtc[.]com:443</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>登录自启动</span></p></td><td><span><span>HKCU\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run</span></span><p><span>，名称&nbsp;</span><span><span>SecureModule</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>配置关联值</span></p></td><td><span><span>RADIUSSecret=dgAAAPpMkI7ke494fKEQRUoablcA</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>虚假提示</span></p></td><td><span><span>developer functionality is temporarily paused due to load</span></span><p><span>；</span><span><span>try again in 72 hours</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span>附录 C：只读排查命令</span></p><p><span>以下命令用于 Linux 主机初步核查，不会清除或修改任何文件。结果需结合进程树、网络日志和模型加载记录判断。</span></p><p><span><span># 检查 Shell 启动文件中的看门狗引用</span></span></p><p><span>grep -c&nbsp;</span><span><span>\"svc.py\"</span></span><span>&nbsp;/root/.bashrc /root/.profile ~/.bashrc 2&gt;/dev/null</span></p><p><span><span># 检查代表性载荷目录</span></span></p><p><span>ls -la /tmp/.cch/ 2&gt;/dev/null</span></p><p><span><span># 在进程命令行中查找共用矿池账号</span></span></p><p><span>grep -a&nbsp;</span><span><span>\"krxXJ2PKQW\"</span></span><span>&nbsp;/proc/*/cmdline 2&gt;/dev/null</span></p><p><span><span># 检查到主要反向 Shell／载荷端点的现有连接</span></span></p><p><span>ss -tnp | grep -E \"212\\.32\\.253\\.3:(443|9443|8898)\" 2&gt;/dev/null</span></p><p><span><span># 检查第一波 SSH 公钥注释</span></span></p><p><span>grep&nbsp;</span><span><span>\"qx-5090-op\"</span></span><span>&nbsp;\\</span></p><p><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; /root/.ssh/authorized_keys \\</span></p><p><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; ~/.ssh/authorized_keys \\</span></p><p><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; /home/xinference/.ssh/authorized_keys 2&gt;/dev/null</span></p><p><span>Windows 侧可重点核查：PowerShell 与代理执行日志中是否出现上述仓库或域名、</span><span><span>SecureModule</span></span><span>&nbsp;运行键、隐藏目录及非预期 NetSupport 组件。若确认执行过相关命令，应同时排查代理会话日志和开发者主机，而不是只清理 README 或仓库缓存。</span></p><p><span>参考链接</span></p><p><strong><span>1. Pluto Security：Load/Mine—A Hugging Face Malware Campaign Returns After Takedown</span></strong><span><br></span><span><span><a href=\"https://pluto.security/blog/hugging-face-malware-campaign-load-mine/\">https://pluto.security/blog/hugging-face-malware-campaign-load-mine/</a></span></span></p><p><strong><span>2. BleepingComputer：Hugging Face malware campaign returns to hijack GPUs for crypto mining</span></strong><span><br></span><span><span><a href=\"https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/hugging-face-malware-campaign-returns-to-hijack-gpus-for-crypto-mining/\">https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/hugging-face-malware-campaign-returns-to-hijack-gpus-for-crypto-mining/</a></span></span></p><p><strong><span>3. Air Security：SolanaCry—Malware in the wild steals crypto wallets from web-browsing AI agents</span></strong><span><br></span><span><span><a href=\"https://www.air.security/blog-posts/solanacry\">https://www.air.security/blog-posts/solanacry</a></span></span></p><p><strong><span>4. Hugging Face Transformers：Custom models 与&nbsp;</span><span><span>trust_remote_code</span></span></strong><span><br></span><span><span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/en/models\">https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/en/models</a></span></span></p><p><strong><span>5. Hugging Face Hub：Malware Scanning</span></strong><span><br></span><span><span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/security-malware\">https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/security-malware</a></span></span></p><p><strong><span>6. Hugging Face Hub：Pickle Scanning</span></strong><span><br></span><span><span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/security-pickle\">https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/security-pickle</a></span></span></p><p><strong><span>7. MITRE ATT&amp;CK：Enterprise Techniques</span></strong><span><br></span><span><span><a href=\"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/enterprise/\">https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/enterprise/</a></span></span></p><p><strong><span>8. 相关 GitHub 仓库页面：SolanaUpdateTools/solana-starter-kit</span></strong><span><br></span><span><span><a href=\"https://github.com/SolanaUpdateTools/solana-starter-kit\">https://github.com/SolanaUpdateTools/solana-starter-kit</a></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://ti.qianxin.com/portal\">阅读原文</a></p><p><a href=\"https://wechat2rss.xlab.app/link-proxy/?k=575ea450&amp;r=1&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%3F__biz%3DMzI2MDc2MDA4OA%3D%3D%26mid%3D2247521244%26idx%3D1%26sn%3De8992e0f55281e055dbc99ffe2538195\">跳转微信打开</a></p>","original","zhKind","complete","挖矿","后门","AI 供应链","AI 编码","阿里","Microsoft","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MDc2MDA4OA==&mid=2247521244&idx=1&sn=e8992e0f55281e055dbc99ffe2538195","奇安信威胁情报中心",{"_84":85,"_86":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
